{
 "version": 1,
 "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-6",
 "asignatura": "matematicas",
 "anio": 2007,
 "convocatoria": "Reserva 6",
 "documento": "MAT-2007-RESERVA_6.pdf",
 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-6-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Determina la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) sabiendo que \\(f''(x)=x^2-1\\) y que la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=0\\) es la recta \\(y=1\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La tangente en \\(x=0\\) es \\(y=1\\): pasa por \\((0,1)\\) y es horizontal, así que \\(f(0)=1\\) y \\(f'(0)=0\\).</p>\\[f'(x)=\\int(x^2-1)\\,dx=\\frac{x^3}3-x+C_1,\\qquad f'(0)=C_1=0\\]\\[f(x)=\\int\\left(\\frac{x^3}3-x\\right)dx=\\frac{x^4}{12}-\\frac{x^2}2+C_2,\\qquad f(0)=C_2=1\\]<div class='res'>\\(f(x)=\\dfrac{x^4}{12}-\\dfrac{x^2}2+1\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "pcond",
     "apartados": ""
    },
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "tang",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2007-RESERVA_6.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-6-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Calcula \\(\\beta\\gt0\\) para que el área del recinto limitado por las gráficas de las funciones \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) y \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definidas por \\(f(x)=x^2\\) y \\(g(x)=-x^2+2\\beta^2\\) sea 72 (unidades de área).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Cortes:</b> \\(x^2=-x^2+2\\beta^2\\iff x^2=\\beta^2\\iff x=\\pm\\beta\\). Entre ellos \\(g\\) (parábola hacia abajo) va por encima. (Dibujo con \\(\\beta=3\\).)</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='63.3,112.1 67.7,104.7 72.0,97.8 76.3,91.2 80.7,85.0 85.0,79.1 89.3,73.7 93.7,68.6 98.0,63.9 102.3,59.5 106.7,55.6 111.0,52.0 115.3,48.8 119.7,46.0 124.0,43.5 128.3,41.5 132.7,39.8 137.0,38.4 141.3,37.5 145.7,36.9 150.0,36.7 154.3,36.9 158.7,37.5 163.0,38.4 167.3,39.8 171.7,41.5 176.0,43.5 180.3,46.0 184.7,48.8 189.0,52.0 193.3,55.6 197.7,59.5 202.0,63.9 206.3,68.6 210.7,73.7 215.0,79.1 219.3,85.0 223.7,91.2 228.0,97.8 232.3,104.7 236.7,112.1 236.7,112.1 232.3,119.4 228.0,126.4 223.7,133.0 219.3,139.2 215.0,145.1 210.7,150.5 206.3,155.6 202.0,160.3 197.7,164.6 193.3,168.6 189.0,172.2 184.7,175.4 180.3,178.2 176.0,180.7 171.7,182.7 167.3,184.4 163.0,185.7 158.7,186.7 154.3,187.3 150.0,187.4 145.7,187.3 141.3,186.7 137.0,185.7 132.7,184.4 128.3,182.7 124.0,180.7 119.7,178.2 115.3,175.4 111.0,172.2 106.7,168.6 102.3,164.6 98.0,160.3 93.7,155.6 89.3,150.5 85.0,145.1 80.7,139.2 76.3,133.0 72.0,126.4 67.7,119.4 63.3,112.1' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='22.9,25.4 27.1,36.0 31.4,46.2 35.6,56.2 39.8,65.7 44.1,74.9 48.3,83.7 52.5,92.2 56.8,100.3 61.0,108.0 65.3,115.4 69.5,122.4 73.7,129.1 78.0,135.4 82.2,141.3 86.4,146.9 90.7,152.1 94.9,157.0 99.2,161.5 103.4,165.7 107.6,169.4 111.9,172.9 116.1,175.9 120.3,178.6 124.6,181.0 128.8,182.9 133.1,184.6 137.3,185.8 141.5,186.7 145.8,187.3 150.0,187.4 154.2,187.3 158.5,186.7 162.7,185.8 166.9,184.6 171.2,182.9 175.4,181.0 179.7,178.6 183.9,175.9 188.1,172.9 192.4,169.4 196.6,165.7 200.8,161.5 205.1,157.0 209.3,152.1 213.6,146.9 217.8,141.3 222.0,135.4 226.3,129.1 230.5,122.4 234.7,115.4 239.0,108.0 243.2,100.3 247.5,92.2 251.7,83.7 255.9,74.9 260.2,65.7 264.4,56.2 268.6,46.2 272.9,36.0 277.1,25.4' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='22.9,198.8 27.1,188.2 31.4,177.9 35.6,168.0 39.8,158.5 44.1,149.3 48.3,140.5 52.5,132.0 56.8,123.9 61.0,116.2 65.3,108.8 69.5,101.8 73.7,95.1 78.0,88.8 82.2,82.8 86.4,77.3 90.7,72.0 94.9,67.2 99.2,62.7 103.4,58.5 107.6,54.8 111.9,51.3 116.1,48.3 120.3,45.6 124.6,43.2 128.8,41.2 133.1,39.6 137.3,38.4 141.5,37.5 145.8,36.9 150.0,36.7 154.2,36.9 158.5,37.5 162.7,38.4 166.9,39.6 171.2,41.2 175.4,43.2 179.7,45.6 183.9,48.3 188.1,51.3 192.4,54.8 196.6,58.5 200.8,62.7 205.1,67.2 209.3,72.0 213.6,77.3 217.8,82.8 222.0,88.8 226.3,95.1 230.5,101.8 234.7,108.8 239.0,116.2 243.2,123.9 247.5,132.0 251.7,140.5 255.9,149.3 260.2,158.5 264.4,168.0 268.6,177.9 272.9,188.2 277.1,198.8' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='63.3' cy='112.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='5.3' y='108.1'>(−β,β²)</text><circle cx='236.7' cy='112.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='242.7' y='108.1'>(β,β²)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 187.4H294.0M150.0 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='63.3' y1='184.4' x2='63.3' y2='190.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='60.3' y='201.4' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='236.7' y1='184.4' x2='236.7' y2='190.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='233.7' y='201.4' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='147.0' y1='112.1' x2='153.0' y2='112.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='116.1' font-size='10'>9</text><line x1='147.0' y1='36.7' x2='153.0' y2='36.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='40.7' font-size='10'>18</text></svg></div>\\[A=\\int_{-\\beta}^{\\beta}(2\\beta^2-2x^2)\\,dx=\\Bigl[2\\beta^2x-\\frac{2x^3}3\\Bigr]_{-\\beta}^{\\beta}=2\\left(2\\beta^3-\\frac{2\\beta^3}3\\right)=\\frac{8\\beta^3}3\\]\\[\\frac{8\\beta^3}3=72\\iff\\beta^3=27\\iff\\beta=3\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\beta=3\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
