  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-6-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(A\\) la matriz \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}3&0&\\lambda\\\\-5&\\lambda&-5\\\\\\lambda&0&3\\end{pmatrix}\\) e \\(I\\) la matriz identidad de orden 3.",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula los valores de \\(\\lambda\\) para los que el determinante de \\(A-2I\\) es cero.",
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula la matriz inversa de \\(A-2I\\) para \\(\\lambda=-2\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A-2I=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&\\lambda\\\\-5&\\lambda-2&-5\\\\\\lambda&0&1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A-2I|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&\\lambda\\\\-5&\\lambda-2&-5\\\\\\lambda&0&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(\\lambda - 2+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(\\lambda^{3} - 2 \\lambda^{2}+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=(\\lambda-2)(1-\\lambda^2)\\]<p>\\((\\lambda-2)(1-\\lambda)(1+\\lambda)=0\\iff\\lambda=2,\\ 1,\\ -1\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\lambda=2\\), \\(\\lambda=1\\) o \\(\\lambda=-1\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(\\lambda=-2\\), llamo \\(B=A-2I=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-2\\\\-5&-4&-5\\\\-2&0&1\\end{pmatrix}\\).</p>\\[|B|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&-2\\\\-5&-4&-5\\\\-2&0&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-4+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(-16+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=12\\]<p>Como \\(|B|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(B^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|B|}(\\operatorname{Adj}B)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}B=\\begin{pmatrix}-4 & 15 & -8\\\\0 & -3 & 0\\\\-8 & 15 & -4\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow B^{-1}=\\frac1{12}\\begin{pmatrix}-4 & 0 & -8\\\\15 & -3 & 15\\\\-8 & 0 & -4\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}- \\frac{1}{3} & 0 & - \\frac{2}{3}\\\\\\frac{5}{4} & - \\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{5}{4}\\\\- \\frac{2}{3} & 0 & - \\frac{1}{3}\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\((A-2I)^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}- \\frac{1}{3} & 0 & - \\frac{2}{3}\\\\\\frac{5}{4} & - \\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{5}{4}\\\\- \\frac{2}{3} & 0 & - \\frac{1}{3}\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "det",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "inv",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
