  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-6-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el plano \\(\\pi\\) de ecuación \\(2x+2y-z-6=0\\) y el punto \\(P(1,0,-1)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula la recta que pasa por el punto \\(P\\) y es perpendicular al plano \\(\\pi\\).",
     "(1,25 p.) Encuentra el punto simétrico de \\(P\\) respecto del plano \\(\\pi\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta es perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\): su director es la normal \\(\\vec n=(2,2,-1)\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(s\\equiv(1+2t,\\ 2t,\\ -1-t)\\), \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Uso la recta perpendicular del apartado a).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Recta perpendicular al plano por el punto.</b> Como la recta \\(s\\) y el plano \\(\\pi\\) son perpendiculares, el vector normal del plano es paralelo al vector director de la recta<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si la recta es perpendicular al plano, su dirección es la del vector normal del plano: por eso sirve \\(\\vec n\\) como vector director.</i>: \\(\\vec d=\\vec n=(2,\\ 2,\\ -1)\\). Pasa por \\(P(1,\\ 0,\\ -1)\\):</p>\\[s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=1+2t\\\\y=2t\\\\z=-1-t\\end{cases}\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(s\\) en \\(\\pi\\equiv 2x+2y-z-6=0\\):</p>\\[2(1+2t)+2(2t)-(-1-t)-6=0\\iff 9t-3=0\\iff t=\\frac{1}{3}\\]\\[M\\left(\\frac{5}{3},\\ \\frac{2}{3},\\ -\\frac{4}{3}\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(P\\) y su simétrico \\(P'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{1+a}2=\\frac{5}{3},\\qquad\\frac{b}2=\\frac{2}{3},\\qquad\\frac{-1+c}2=-\\frac{4}{3}\\]\\[a=\\frac{7}{3},\\qquad b=\\frac{4}{3},\\qquad c=-\\frac{5}{3}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":4,\"el\":30,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1.29,1.421,-0.579],[2.421,0.29,-0.579],[2.044,-0.088,-2.088],[0.912,1.044,-2.088]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[2.044,-0.088,-2.088],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[0.767,-0.233,-0.883],[2.567,1.567,-1.783],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.567,1.567,-1.783],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[0.8,-0.2,-0.9],[1.267,0.267,-1.133],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[2.091,0.242,-1.333],[2.558,0.709,-1.567],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",4,-4],[\"line\",[1.52,0.52,-1.26],[1.676,0.364,-1.26],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.676,0.364,-1.26],[1.822,0.511,-1.333],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[1.0,0.0,-1.0],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1.667,0.667,-1.333],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[2.333,1.333,-1.667],\"P′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m07r6a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m07r6a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m07r6a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m07r6a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='237.5,25.2 79.2,94.0 33.4,238.8 191.6,170.0' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='37.4' y='238.8' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='26.0' y1='18.0' x2='244.8' y2='246.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='250.8' y='246.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='30.1' y1='22.2' x2='86.8' y2='81.3' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m07r6a4d)'/><text x='90.8' y='77.3' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='76.1' y1='157.8' x2='132.8' y2='216.9' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m07r6a4n)'/><text x='136.8' y='212.9' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><line x1='117.6' y1='113.4' x2='95.8' y2='122.9' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='95.8' y1='122.9' x2='113.7' y2='141.5' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='54.4' cy='47.6' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='61.4' y='41.6' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='135.4' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x=