   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el plano \\(\\pi\\) de ecuación \\(2x+2y-z-6=0\\) y la recta \\(r\\) definida por \\(\\dfrac{x-1}2=\\dfrac{y+1}{-1}=\\dfrac z2\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula el área del triángulo cuyos vértices son los puntos de corte del plano \\(\\pi\\) con los ejes de coordenadas.",
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula, razonadamente, la distancia de la recta \\(r\\) al plano \\(\\pi\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Cortes con los ejes: \\(y=z=0\\Rightarrow A(3,0,0)\\); \\(x=z=0\\Rightarrow B(0,3,0)\\); \\(x=y=0\\Rightarrow C(0,0,-6)\\).</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-3,3,0),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AC}=(-3,0,-6),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-3&3&0\\\\-3&0&-6\\end{vmatrix}=(-18,\\,-18,\\,9)\\]\\[\\text{Área}=\\frac12\\sqrt{324+324+81}=\\frac12\\sqrt{729}=\\frac{27}2\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{27}2\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(1,-1,0)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(2,-1,2)\\). \\(\\vec d\\cdot\\vec n=4-2-2=0\\): \\(r\\) es paralela al plano o está contenida en él. \\(R\\) no está en \\(\\pi\\) (\\(2-2-0-6=-6\\neq0\\)): son paralelos.</p><p>La distancia es la de \\(R\\) al plano. Perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\) por \\(R\\): \\((1+2s,\\,-1+2s,\\,-s)\\). Corte: \\(2+4s-2+4s+s-6=0\\iff s=\\frac23\\): \\(M\\left(\\frac73,\\frac13,-\\frac23\\right)\\).</p>\\[d(r,\\pi)=|\\overrightarrow{RM}|=\\left|\\left(\\tfrac43,\\tfrac43,-\\tfrac23\\right)\\right|=\\sqrt{\\frac{16+16+4}9}=2\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":93,\"el\":28,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[3,0,0],[0,3,0],[0,0,-6]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[-1.4,0.2,-2.4],[3.4,-2.2,2.4],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.4,-2.2,2.4],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[1,-1,0],[2.333,0.333,-0.667],\"#e11d48\",1.6,false],[\"pt\",[3,0,0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,3,0],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,0,-6],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,-1,0],\"R\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2.333,0.333,-0.667],\"M\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m07r6b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m07r6b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m07r6b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m07r6b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='33.6,102.5 109.5,142.0 113.7,246.0' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='150.7' y1='164.5' x2='26.0' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='88.4' y1='91.2' x2='50.9' y2='122.8' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='33.6' cy='102.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='40.6' y='96.5' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='109.5' cy='142.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='116.5' y='136.0' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='113.7' cy='246.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='120.7' y='240.0' font-weight='700'>C</text><circle cx='88.4' cy='91.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='95.4' y='85.2' font-weight='700'>R</text><circle cx='50.9' cy='122.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='57.9' y='116.8' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='8.0' y2='269.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='-0.6' y='273.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='23.2' y2='277.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='19.9' y='284.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(d(r,\\pi)=2\\) unidades</div><i class='n' data-t='fm'>Comprobación: \\(d(R,\\pi)=\\dfrac{|2-2-0-6|}{\\sqrt{4+4+1}}=\\dfrac63=2\\) ✓.</i></div>"
